{"id":"9e8ef1dcabc07c85","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/767_概念图_Conceptual_Graphs.md","title":"767 概念图 Conceptual Graphs","display":"767_概念图_Conceptual_Graphs","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"767-概念图-Conceptual-Graphs\">767 概念图 Conceptual Graphs</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(T_C,\\preceq_C,T_R,\\preceq_R,\\operatorname{ar},M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(T_C,\\preceq_C,T_R,\\preceq_R,\\operatorname{ar},M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span> 是概念类型集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R\">\\(T_R\\)</span> 是关系类型集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是个体标记集合，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_C\\subseteq T_C^2\">\\(\\preceq_C\\subseteq T_C^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_R\\subseteq T_R^2\">\\(\\preceq_R\\subseteq T_R^2\\)</span> 均为自反传递关系，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}:T_R\\to\\{1,2,3,\\ldots\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}:T_R\\to\\{1,2,3,\\ldots\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系类型特化保持元数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\preceq_R t\\Longrightarrow \\operatorname{ar}(s)=\\operatorname{ar}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\preceq_R t\\Longrightarrow \\operatorname{ar}(s)=\\operatorname{ar}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念节点名集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(N_C=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，关系节点名集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(N_R=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，二者不交。</p>\n<p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C,T_R,M,N_C,N_R,\\{\\ast\\}\">\\(T_C,T_R,M,N_C,N_R,\\{\\ast\\}\\)</span> 两两不交。</p>\n<p>定义节点 sort 与构造子标签：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Node}_{CG}=N_C\\cup N_R,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{CG}(c)=\\mathsf{conceptNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{CG}(r)=\\mathsf{relationNode},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Node}_{CG}=N_C\\cup N_R,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{CG}(c)=\\mathsf{conceptNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{sort}_{CG}(r)=\\mathsf{relationNode},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conceptNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{relationNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{incidence},\\quad\n\\operatorname{graph}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conceptNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{relationNode},\\quad\n\\operatorname{incidence},\\quad\n\\operatorname{graph}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念图\">2. 概念图</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为满足下列形成条款的最小集合。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是六元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=(C,R,\\tau_C,\\mu,\\tau_R,\\iota)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=(C,R,\\tau_C,\\mu,\\tau_R,\\iota)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}N_C\">\\(C\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}N_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}N_R\">\\(R\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}N_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C:C\\to T_C\">\\(\\tau_C:C\\to T_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:C\\to M\\cup\\{\\ast\\}\">\\(\\mu:C\\to M\\cup\\{\\ast\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ast\">\\(\\ast\\)</span> 是未指定标记。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_R:R\\to T_R\">\\(\\tau_R:R\\to T_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(r):\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))\\to C\">\\(\\iota(r):\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))\\to C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由名字、重命名与替换\">3. 自由名字、重命名与替换</h1>\n<p>自由名字函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(G)=C\\cup R\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau_C)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau_R)\\cup(\\operatorname{rng}(\\mu)\\cap M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(G)=C\\cup R\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau_C)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau_R)\\cup(\\operatorname{rng}(\\mu)\\cap M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念图没有绑定名字，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(G)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BN}(G)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>节点重命名是一对有限支撑双射</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\qquad \\rho_R:N_R\\to N_R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\qquad \\rho_R:N_R\\to N_R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并作用为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(G)=(\\rho_C[C],\\rho_R[R],\\tau_C&#39;,\\mu&#39;,\\tau_R&#39;,\\iota&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(G)=(\\rho_C[C],\\rho_R[R],\\tau_C&#39;,\\mu&#39;,\\tau_R&#39;,\\iota&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C&#39;(\\rho_C(c))=\\tau_C(c),\\quad\n\\mu&#39;(\\rho_C(c))=\\mu(c),\\quad\n\\tau_R&#39;(\\rho_R(r))=\\tau_R(r),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_C&#39;(\\rho_C(c))=\\tau_C(c),\\quad\n\\mu&#39;(\\rho_C(c))=\\mu(c),\\quad\n\\tau_R&#39;(\\rho_R(r))=\\tau_R(r),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota&#39;(\\rho_R(r))(i)=\\rho_C(\\iota(r)(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota&#39;(\\rho_R(r))(i)=\\rho_C(\\iota(r)(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\equiv_\\alpha H\">\\(G\\equiv_\\alpha H\\)</span> 当且仅当存在上述节点重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\rho(G)\">\\(H=\\rho(G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义重命名族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{CG}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\rho}:\\rho=(\\rho_C,\\rho_R),\\rho_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\rho_R:N_R\\to N_R\\text{ 是有限支撑双射}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{CG}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\rho}:\\rho=(\\rho_C,\\rho_R),\\rho_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\rho_R:N_R\\to N_R\\text{ 是有限支撑双射}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\rho}(G)=\\rho(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\rho}(G)=\\rho(G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-投影\">4. 投影</h1>\n<p>概念类型序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_C\">\\(\\preceq_C\\)</span> 与关系类型序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_R\">\\(\\preceq_R\\)</span> 由签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 固定。</p>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(C,R,\\tau_C,\\mu,\\tau_R,\\iota)\">\\(G=(C,R,\\tau_C,\\mu,\\tau_R,\\iota)\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(C&#39;,R&#39;,\\tau_C&#39;,\\mu&#39;,\\tau_R&#39;,\\iota&#39;)\">\\(H=(C&#39;,R&#39;,\\tau_C&#39;,\\mu&#39;,\\tau_R&#39;,\\iota&#39;)\\)</span> 的投影是两函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_C:C\\to C&#39;,\\qquad p_R:R\\to R&#39;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_C:C\\to C&#39;,\\qquad p_R:R\\to R&#39;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C&#39;(p_C(c))\\preceq_C\\tau_C(c)\">\\(\\tau_C&#39;(p_C(c))\\preceq_C\\tau_C(c)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(c)\\in M\">\\(\\mu(c)\\in M\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu&#39;(p_C(c))=\\mu(c)\">\\(\\mu&#39;(p_C(c))=\\mu(c)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_R&#39;(p_R(r))\\preceq_R\\tau_R(r)\">\\(\\tau_R&#39;(p_R(r))\\preceq_R\\tau_R(r)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))=\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R&#39;(p_R(r)))\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))=\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R&#39;(p_R(r)))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))\">\\(i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R(r))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C(\\iota(r)(i))=\\iota&#39;(p_R(r))(i)\">\\(p_C(\\iota(r)(i))=\\iota&#39;(p_R(r))(i)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}(G,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj}(G,H)\\)</span> 表示存在上述投影。</p>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}\\subseteq\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\times\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj}\\subseteq\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\times\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是确定的二元关系；投影不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C,p_R\">\\(p_C,p_R\\)</span> 为单射，故允许把查询中的多个节点识别到同一目标节点。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-规则\">5. 规则</h1>\n<p>图库 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)=\\mathcal B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)=\\mathcal B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义二图不交谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj}(G,H)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_G\\cap C_H=\\varnothing\\ \\wedge\\ R_G\\cap R_H=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Disj}(G,H)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_G\\cap C_H=\\varnothing\\ \\wedge\\ R_G\\cap R_H=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,K\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G,H,K\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Join}(G,H,K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Join}(G,H,K)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj}(G,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Disj}(G,H)\\)</span> 且：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_K=C_G\\cup C_H,\\qquad R_K=R_G\\cup R_H,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_K=C_G\\cup C_H,\\qquad R_K=R_G\\cup R_H,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C^K(c)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\tau_C^G(c),&amp;c\\in C_G,\\\\\n\\tau_C^H(c),&amp;c\\in C_H,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\mu_K(c)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mu_G(c),&amp;c\\in C_G,\\\\\n\\mu_H(c),&amp;c\\in C_H,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_C^K(c)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\tau_C^G(c),&amp;c\\in C_G,\\\\\n\\tau_C^H(c),&amp;c\\in C_H,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\mu_K(c)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mu_G(c),&amp;c\\in C_G,\\\\\n\\mu_H(c),&amp;c\\in C_H,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_R^K(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\tau_R^G(r),&amp;r\\in R_G,\\\\\n\\tau_R^H(r),&amp;r\\in R_H,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_R^K(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\tau_R^G(r),&amp;r\\in R_G,\\\\\n\\tau_R^H(r),&amp;r\\in R_H,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_K(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\iota_G(r),&amp;r\\in R_G,\\\\\n\\iota_H(r),&amp;r\\in R_H.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_K(r)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\iota_G(r),&amp;r\\in R_G,\\\\\n\\iota_H(r),&amp;r\\in R_H.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Restrict}(G,c,t,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Restrict}(G,c,t,H)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C_G\">\\(c\\in C_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T_C\">\\(t\\in T_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\preceq_C\\tau_C^G(c)\">\\(t\\preceq_C\\tau_C^G(c)\\)</span>，并且：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_H=C_G,\\quad R_H=R_G,\\quad \\mu_H=\\mu_G,\\quad \\tau_R^H=\\tau_R^G,\\quad \\iota_H=\\iota_G,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_H=C_G,\\quad R_H=R_G,\\quad \\mu_H=\\mu_G,\\quad \\tau_R^H=\\tau_R^G,\\quad \\iota_H=\\iota_G,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C^H(d)=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;d=c,\\\\\n\\tau_C^G(d),&amp;d\\ne c.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_C^H(d)=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;d=c,\\\\\n\\tau_C^G(d),&amp;d\\ne c.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>复制规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}=\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\ G\\equiv_\\alpha H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}=\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\ G\\equiv_\\alpha H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>连接规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}=\\{((G,H),K):G,H,K\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Join}(G,H,K)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}=\\{((G,H),K):G,H,K\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Join}(G,H,K)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>类型限制规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}=\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\exists c\\in C_G\\,\\exists t\\in T_C\\ \\operatorname{Restrict}(G,c,t,H)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}=\\{((G),H):G,H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\exists c\\in C_G\\,\\exists t\\in T_C\\ \\operatorname{Restrict}(G,c,t,H)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>投影查询规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}=\\{((G),Q):G,Q\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Proj}(Q,G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}=\\{((G),Q):G,Q\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Proj}(Q,G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的概念图证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\">\\(p=(G_0,\\ldots,G_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G_i\\in\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>以下第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 个条件逐一、分别定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell(\\mathcal B,p,i)\">\\(L_\\ell(\\mathcal B,p,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq\\ell\\leq 5\">\\(1\\leq\\ell\\leq 5\\)</span>）；每行至少满足其中一个条件。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(G_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}\">\\(((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G_j,G_k),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\">\\(((G_j,G_k),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}\">\\(((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\">\\(((G_j),G_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可的唯一组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{5} L_\\ell(\\mathcal B,p,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{5} L_\\ell(\\mathcal B,p,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节的证明条件是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,i)\\)</span>；本节定义的证明对象、证明谓词及可导出关系均采用此条件。序列须非空、有限且逐行有型；末项条件和各分支的严格早索引条件同时保留。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是满足本节五类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导出关系\">7. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-闭包结构与后承\">8. 闭包结构与后承</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{CG}=\\{\\mathcal B:\\mathcal B\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{CG}=\\{\\mathcal B:\\mathcal B\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义闭包结构集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{CG}Q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{CG}Q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in X\">\\(Q\\in X\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,X)\\)</span> 当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG}(\\mathcal B)\\subseteq X\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G_0,\\ldots,G_{\\ell-1}),H)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG}\">\\(((G_0,\\ldots,G_{\\ell-1}),H)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i\\in X\">\\(G_i\\in X\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\ell\">\\(i&lt;\\ell\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in X\">\\(H\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>图后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{CG}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,X)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{CG}Q\">\\(X\\models_{CG}Q\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-特征差异\">9. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>定义二部图载体条件</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bip}_{CG}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_G\\subseteq N_C\\ \\wedge\\ R_G\\subseteq N_R\\ \\wedge\n\\forall r\\in R_G\\ \\operatorname{rng}(\\iota_G(r))\\subseteq C_G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bip}_{CG}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC_G\\subseteq N_C\\ \\wedge\\ R_G\\subseteq N_R\\ \\wedge\n\\forall r\\in R_G\\ \\operatorname{rng}(\\iota_G(r))\\subseteq C_G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{CG}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{Bip}_{CG}(G)\\},\n\\preceq_C,\n\\preceq_R,\n\\operatorname{Proj},\n\\operatorname{Join},\n\\operatorname{Restrict},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{join},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{CG}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{Bip}_{CG}(G)\\},\n\\preceq_C,\n\\preceq_R,\n\\operatorname{Proj},\n\\operatorname{Join},\n\\operatorname{Restrict},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{join},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它把二部概念图、类型特化序、图投影及四类独立规则行型作为可检查对象；一阶公式翻译与数据库查询优化不属于该对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CG}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Node}_{CG},\\operatorname{sort}_{CG},\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{Ren}_{CG},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\preceq_C,\\preceq_R,\\operatorname{Proj},\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{Join},\\operatorname{Restrict},\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG},\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy},\\mathsf{Rule}_{join},\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict},\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj},\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG},\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{KB}_{CG},\\mathsf{Str}_{CG},\\models_{CG},\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{CG}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CG}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Node}_{CG},\\operatorname{sort}_{CG},\\mathsf{CG}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{Ren}_{CG},\\equiv_\\alpha,\\preceq_C,\\preceq_R,\\operatorname{Proj},\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{Join},\\operatorname{Restrict},\\mathsf{Ax}_{CG},\\mathsf{Rule}_{copy},\\mathsf{Rule}_{join},\\mathsf{Rule}_{restrict},\\mathsf{Rule}_{proj},\\mathsf{Rule}_{CG},\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{KB}_{CG},\\mathsf{Str}_{CG},\\models_{CG},\\operatorname{Closed}_{CG},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{CG}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含概念图投影证明与闭包式后承；不含一阶公式翻译、自然语言解析或数据库查询优化。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-图模式查询、投影证书与答案映射\">11. 图模式查询、投影证书与答案映射</h1>\n<p>查询模式载体定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}=\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}=\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=(C_Q,R_Q,\\tau_C^Q,\\mu_Q,\\tau_R^Q,\\iota_Q)\\in\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}\">\\(Q=(C_Q,R_Q,\\tau_C^Q,\\mu_Q,\\tau_R^Q,\\iota_Q)\\in\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}\\)</span>，满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_Q(c)=\\ast\">\\(\\mu_Q(c)=\\ast\\)</span> 的概念节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是查询中的未指定节点槽；查询答案直接返回节点投影映射，无需另设项替换。</p>\n<p>给定图库 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{CG}\">\\(\\mathcal B\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{CG}\\)</span> 与查询模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG}\\)</span>，定义有限投影证书关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q,H,p_C,p_R,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q,H,p_C,p_R,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,p,H)\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是第 6 节定义的、末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的有限证明；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C:C_Q\\to C_H\">\\(p_C:C_Q\\to C_H\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_R:R_Q\\to R_H\">\\(p_R:R_Q\\to R_H\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C_Q\">\\(c\\in C_Q\\)</span>，</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C^H(p_C(c))\\preceq_C\\tau_C^Q(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_C^H(p_C(c))\\preceq_C\\tau_C^Q(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_Q(c)\\in M\">\\(\\mu_Q(c)\\in M\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_H(p_C(c))=\\mu_Q(c);\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_H(p_C(c))=\\mu_Q(c);\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"5\">\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R_Q\">\\(r\\in R_Q\\)</span>，</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_R^H(p_R(r))\\preceq_R\\tau_R^Q(r),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_R^H(p_R(r))\\preceq_R\\tau_R^Q(r),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^Q(r))\n=\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^H(p_R(r))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^Q(r))\n=\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^H(p_R(r))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^Q(r))\">\\(i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(\\tau_R^Q(r))\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_C(\\iota_Q(r)(i))=\\iota_H(p_R(r))(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_C(\\iota_Q(r)(i))=\\iota_H(p_R(r))(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>答案映射集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q)\n=\n\\{(p_C,p_R):\\exists H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\exists p\\ \n\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q,H,p_C,p_R,p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ans}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q)\n=\n\\{(p_C,p_R):\\exists H\\in\\mathsf{CG}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\exists p\\ \n\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG}(\\mathcal B,Q,H,p_C,p_R,p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此一个图模式的答案不只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\">\\(\\mathcal B\\vdash_{\\operatorname{CG}}Q\\)</span>，还携带可逐节点、逐关联位置检查的匹配映射和支持该目标图的有限证明。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-含查询层的整个形式系统\">12. 含查询层的整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S^{\\mathrm{full}}_{\\operatorname{CG}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG},\n\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG},\\operatorname{Ans}_{CG}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S^{\\mathrm{full}}_{\\operatorname{CG}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{CG}},\\mathsf{QPat}_{CG},\n\\operatorname{ProjCert}_{CG},\\operatorname{Ans}_{CG}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该扩展系统含概念图模式查询、有限投影证书与答案映射；不含一阶公式翻译、自然语言解析或数据库查询优化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"767-概念图-Conceptual-Graphs","text":"767 概念图 Conceptual Graphs","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念图","text":"2. 概念图","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由名字、重命名与替换","text":"3. 自由名字、重命名与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-投影","text":"4. 投影","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则","text":"5. 规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导出关系","text":"7. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-闭包结构与后承","text":"8. 闭包结构与后承","level":1},{"id":"9.-特征差异","text":"9. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"11.-图模式查询、投影证书与答案映射","text":"11. 图模式查询、投影证书与答案映射","level":1},{"id":"12.-含查询层的整个形式系统","text":"12. 含查询层的整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(T_C,\\preceq_C,T_R,\\preceq_R,\\operatorname{ar},M)","display":true},{"tex":"T_C","display":false},{"tex":"T_R","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_C\\subseteq T_C^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_R\\subseteq T_R^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}:T_R\\to\\{1,2,3,\\ldots\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\preceq_R t\\Longrightarrow \\operatorname{ar}(s)=\\operatorname{ar}(t).","display":true},{"tex":"N_C=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N_R=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex"